{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、部屋に熱帯魚を飼いたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋の中に\nニモとかドリーの世界を\n作り出せたらどんなに癒しだろう～と妄想しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけできっと1週間なにもしないで過ごせる気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そよそよ～そよそよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はパシフィコ横浜で個別握手会でした!\nすごく楽しかったです。皆さんにも同じくらい楽しいって思って頂けてるのかな〜⊂⌒っ´・ω・)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも来て良かったなって気分になってもらえるような握手会にします(したいです)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょんこハートーーー( ◜︎◡︎◝︎ )❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB84KRB2NRZ12XSRGACT2E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"きょんこハート\"こと齊藤京子ちゃんです。\n浴衣カワイイ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はpaul smith展で買ったTシャツを着たよ〜灰色のシャツもきたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB85KFQAP29DHRR3R1EV16","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは別の日の写真だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のタイトルの「馬の世界史」はゆっかーが楽屋で読んでいた本です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっかーは馬といるといつも以上のとびきりの笑顔を見せてくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その笑顔をまだ引き出せない長濱。恐るべし、馬。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『馬の世界史』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01